From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Thuong Vo <66083331+SekiroKenjii@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:07:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: compile the Apex resource into ptyxis

The Apex terminal ships inside Ptyxis. Its sources come from Source100, a
git archive of desktop/ptyxis/ in apex-gnome, which %prep unpacks at the
top of this tree as src/apex/. src/meson.build reads src/apex/meson.build
right after upstream's resources, which adds the Apex resource,
/org/gnome/Ptyxis/apex, to ptyxis_sources.
---
 src/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 575f08c..045b542 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -59,6 +59,7 @@ ptyxis_sources += gnome.compile_resources('ptyxis-resources',
   'ptyxis.gresource.xml',
   c_name: 'ptyxis'
 )
+subdir('apex')
 
 ptyxis_sources += vcs_tag(
       command: ['git', 'describe'],
